WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.208 --> 00:00:01.543
What rank are you?

00:00:02.210 --> 00:00:03.211
Ascendant Three.

00:00:03.378 --> 00:00:03.878
Damn.

00:00:03.878 --> 00:00:04.546
Really?

00:00:04.963 --> 00:00:06.256
That's better than him.

00:00:06.256 --> 00:00:07.090
Wait.

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:08.591
That's incredible.

00:00:08.591 --> 00:00:10.301
How long you been playing for?

00:00:10.677 --> 00:00:11.636
I mean, since I can--

00:00:11.636 --> 00:00:14.347
It's cool your
brother's Kyllboi.

00:00:14.347 --> 00:00:15.140
Is it?

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:16.641
Yeah, he's the real deal.

00:00:19.769 --> 00:00:21.938
So is this your--

00:00:21.938 --> 00:00:23.064
Oh, god.

00:00:23.064 --> 00:00:24.149
No.

00:00:24.149 --> 00:00:24.983
No, no, no, no.

00:00:24.983 --> 00:00:26.860
I found him, just over there.

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:27.861
Over there?

00:00:27.861 --> 00:00:28.695
Yeah.

00:00:28.695 --> 00:00:30.572
Just hanging out?

00:00:30.572 --> 00:00:32.741
It's time for the finals.

00:00:32.741 --> 00:00:36.327
Team Valkyrie and Team iiTzTimmy

00:00:36.327 --> 00:00:37.912
on to the stage.

00:00:37.912 --> 00:00:40.206
[CHEERING]

00:00:42.167 --> 00:00:43.126
Hey.

00:00:43.126 --> 00:00:43.918
Let's go.

00:00:47.922 --> 00:00:48.882
Use Kyllboi.

00:00:51.676 --> 00:00:53.261
Are you up for it?

00:00:53.261 --> 00:00:54.220
The finals?

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:55.722
Yeah, this is one
of those moments, man.

00:00:55.722 --> 00:00:56.514
Are you in or out?

00:01:00.143 --> 00:01:01.019
In.

